    <string name="about_tagline">Umugenzi wuzuye, wubuntu, ufunguye-isoko kuri buri Muyisilamu - ibihe byamasengesho, Adhan, Korowani, Hadithi, adhkar nibindi, mururimi rwawe.</string>
    <string name="about_description_title">Ibyerekeye Abayisilamu</string>
    <string name="about_description_body">Umuyisilamu ni porogaramu yubuntu kandi ifunguye isoko ya Android iguherekeza umunsi wose: ibihe byamasengesho yukuri yubumenyi bwikirere hamwe na Adhan, kompasse ya Qibla itomoye, Qor\'ani yuzuye hamwe nibisomwa na tafsir, isomero rya Hadithi, isoko ya adhkar, tasbih ya elegitoronike, ibikoresho bya Ramazani, ibara rya zakat, amakarita ya interineti, nibindi byinshi - byateguwe kugirango bikore neza kuri interineti ukoresheje ubuzima bwite.</string>
    <string name="about_features_title">Ingingo z\'ingenzi</string>
    <string name="about_features_body">Ikintu cyose Umuyisilamu akeneye muri porogaramu imwe:</string>
    <string name="about_feature_prayer">Ibihe byamasengesho &amp; Adhan - uburyo bwose bwo kubara, amashuri yubucamanza, hamwe na 18+ amajwi ya adhan</string>
    <string name="about_feature_quran">Korowani yuzuye - Inyandiko ya Uthmani, 44 abasoma, tafsir, ibisobanuro, gushakisha ijambo &amp; inshuro</string>
    <string name="about_feature_adhkar">Adhkar, tasbih, Ramadhan &amp; Zakat - hamwe nibutsa hamwe nudusimba tureremba</string>
    <string name="about_feature_offline">Offline-yambere - amakarita, Korowani, Hadithi na adhkar bikora nta internet</string>
    <string name="about_feature_privacy">Amabanga asanzwe - nta matangazo, nta gukurikirana, amakuru yawe aguma kubikoresho byawe</string>
